 "title": "Faithfully flat tensoring reflects injectivity",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a commutative ring, let $S$ be a faithfully flat $R$-module [def-weil-pbc-faithfully-flat-ring-map], and let $f:M\\to N$ be an $R$-linear map between $R$-modules [def-weil-pbc-module-tensor-product]. Then the induced map $S\\otimes_R M\\to S\\otimes_R N$ is injective if and only if $f$ is injective.",
